{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1254787-spectrum-s-build-list","id":1254787,"title":"Spectrum's Build List","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-09-16T10:34:55-07:00","id":1254787,"title":"Spectrum's Build List","content":"Hi folks,<br /> <br /> I've been working on some characters for a while now and been having fun at it. So far they've been posted on a different board. Lots of great people but not really oriented towards oWoD, One thing that I've come to realize/reaffirm is that characters really aren't ready and complete until the player and the ST get together. If you have constructive comments, I'd like to hear them. In any case, thank you for reading and hopefully don't bore you too much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12228-spectrum","name":"Spectrum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-16T10:39:38-07:00","id":1254788,"title":"","content":"System: Werewolf 20<br /> <br /> Name: Hits Like Garbage Truck &quot;Clifford&quot;<br /> Concept: Big Friendly Garou<br /> <br /> In homid form, looking at pictures of Mick Foley at his worst, Vlad from Hack/Slash, Marv from Sin City. Not just appearance 1 ugly, but bruiser beaten to hell appearance 0.<br /> <br /> Breed: Lupus, Auspice: Ahroun, Tribe: Bone Gnawers<br /> Gnosis: 5, Rage: 6, Will: 6<br /> Glory 2, Honor 1, Wisdom 0<br /> <br /> Str 4/6/8/7/5 (Unstoppable), Sta 4/6/7/7/6 (Unbreakable), Dex 2/2/3/4/4<br /> Cha 3, Man 2/0/0/0/0, App 0<br /> Int 1, Wits 3, Per 4 (Instinctual)<br /> <br /> Traits: Alertness 2, Athletics 4 (Lupus), Brawl 4 (Tooth and Claw), Intimidate 2, Primal Urge 3, Streetwise 2<br /> Skills: Animal Ken 3, Stealth 3, Survival 3<br /> Knowledges: Enigmas 1, Medicine 2, Rituals 2<br /> <br /> Backgrounds: Kinfolk 2, Mentor 1, Spirit Heritage (Urban) 2, Totem 5<br /> <br /> Gifts: Sense Prey, Razor Claws, Desperate Strength<br /> <br /> Merits: Natural Weapons, Inner Strength<br /> Flaws: Animal Musk, Monstrous, Pack Mentality <br /> <br /> Mechanics Note: Some of the specialities need work. Right direction but maybe too broad.<br /> <br /> Big, looks like he didn't stop chasing the bus in time, smells nasty, doesn't know own strength, overly friendly puppy garou.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12228-spectrum","name":"Spectrum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-16T10:41:23-07:00","id":1254789,"title":"","content":"System: Werewolf 20th<br /> <br /> Name: Vasily Petrovich Dashkov<br /> Concept: Privilege Becomes Prison<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pre00.deviantart.net/12a7/th/pre/i/2011/185/7/8/sabin_duvert_by_fuchsiart-d3ky4fn.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Sabin Duvert by fuchsiart<br /> <br /> Homid, Theurge, Silver Fang<br /> Gnosis 5, Rage 2, Will 3<br /> Glory 0, Honor 0, Wisdom 3<br /> <br /> Str 2, Dex 2, Sta 2<br /> Cha 4 (Captivating), Man 2, App 4 (Noble)<br /> Per 2, Int 2, Wits 4 (Detached)<br /> <br /> Talents: Athletics 1, Empathy 3, Expression 3, Leadership 3, Subterfuge 3<br /> Skills: Animal Ken 1, Etiquette 4 (Tribal), Melee 1, Performance 1<br /> Knowledges: Academics 2, Enigmas 2, Occult 2, Rituals 3<br /> <br /> Backgrounds: Pure Breed 5, Rites 2, Resources 2<br /> <br /> Gifts: Persuasion, Spirit Speech, Inspiration<br /> <br /> Merits: Language (Russian), Natural Leader, Supporter, Spirit Magnet<br /> Flaws: Absent Minded, Enemy (3), Slip Sideways<br /> <br /> Vasily Petrovich Dashov had one job in life- to be a trophy husband- and he failed. Catastrophically. He had the proper breeding, he had the proper schooling, everything that was needed to be a pretty piece of art on the arm of a proper Silver Fang princess. The family hadn't had any garou for generations. Arranged marriages resulted in garou but not direct births. That is where he failed; on his wedding night, Changing and becoming a Litany breaker; as well as his new bride. His host family has had to work to hide this shame, this break of contract, and have the social standing to make his life in the new world very unpleasant. The spirit world calls to him, allowing him escape, at the cost of him not working to improve his social standing. He has been trained to be a pack alpha and yet, yet his own desires lie elsewhere.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12228-spectrum","name":"Spectrum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-16T10:43:19-07:00","id":1254790,"title":"","content":"System: Werewolf 20 Changing Breeds<br /> <img src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/cc/16/c1/cc16c16695a2b64c493e900af87290f1--arkham-games-batman-arkham-asylum.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <img src=\"http://www.anynewsbd.com/images/flying-serpents.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <img src=\"http://rivista-cdn.reptilesmagazine.com/croc-with-tire-around-neck.jpg?ver=1515795077\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> &quot;John Doe&quot;, &quot;The Sewer Monster&quot;, &quot;Oh God, What is th... *crunch*&quot;<br /> Breed: Suchid<br /> Auspice: Noonday Sun, Unshading<br /> Varna: Karna (Saltwater Crocodile)<br /> <br /> Gnosis 8, Willpower 5, Rage 6<br /> <br /> Str 5/9/8 (Steely Grip), Dex 2/1/1, Sta 4/10/7 (Unbreakable)<br /> Cha 1, App 2/0, Man 3/1/1<br /> Int 2, Per 3, Wits 3<br /> <br /> Archid Aspects: Behemoth x2, Constricting Coils, Fiery Pearl, Longteeth, Long neck, Predator's Roar, Wings<br /> Massive albino flying serpent, a burning orb between its yellow eyes, a mawful of tearing fangs, scaled wings twitching in the wind<br /> <br /> Talents: Alertness 3, Athletics 3, Brawl 4 (Wrestling), Intimidation 4 (Physical), Streetwise 1<br /> Skills: Firearms 1, Larceny 2, Stealth 4 (Urban), Survival 3<br /> Knowledges: --<br /> <br /> BGs: Allies 1, Contacts 2, Resources 2<br /> <br /> Gifts: Razor Claws, Fangs of Judgement<br /> <br /> Merits: --<br /> <br /> Flaws: Strict carnivore, Overconfident, Hatred: &quot;Vampires&quot;, Mark of the Predator<br /> <br /> Notes:<br /> 1. One of my oldest unused antagonists, easily 20 years old. In the large Vampire LARP I was involved in, one of the prestories was that the entire clan of Nosferatu (antitribu) were gone- completely, not a trace. When it came to my turn to run the game, I tried to answer the question. In my version, one of the warren was fond of collecting odd crocodiles for their spawning pit. This time, they got more than they expected; a preChange mokole which then proceeded to do the monster movie thing ripping the entire warren apart. Nom.<br /> <br /> 2. Expanding the story, the monster has been hired on the goon squad of a young and overconfident Giovanni to hunt 'vampires'. Yeah, not the smartest of ideas. How long can you hold the tiger by the tail?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12228-spectrum","name":"Spectrum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-16T10:46:42-07:00","id":1254792,"title":"","content":"System: Mage 20<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://78.media.tumblr.com/tumblr_lj7r7w5IYn1qzqk8bo1_540.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Name: Pauline Lucas<br /> Concept: Withdrawn Bibliomancer<br /> Nature: Romantic<br /> Demeanor: Mentor<br /> Essence: Questing<br /> Affiliation: Order of Hermes<br /> <br /> Str 2, Dex 1, Sta 3<br /> Cha 3, Man 1, App 4 (Adorkable)<br /> Per 2, Int 5 (Well Read), Wits 3<br /> <br /> Talents: Art (Writing) 1, Awareness 2, Leadership 2<br /> <br /> Skills: Etiquette 2, Martial Arts 2, Meditation 2, Research 4 (Arcane Collections)<br /> <br /> Knowledge: Academics 4 (Liberal Arts), Cosmology 3, Enigmas 4 (Intuitive Leaps), Esoterica 4 (?), Investigation 1<br /> <br /> Backgrounds: Allies (Spirits) 5, Avatar 3, Library 2<br /> <br /> Arete 2<br /> Willpower 5<br /> Spheres: Forces 2, Mind 1, Spirit 2, Time 1<br /> <br /> Merits: Hyperfocus (3), Spirit Magnet (4)<br /> <br /> Flaws: Rivalry (3), Shy (1), Esoteric Discourse (1), Special Responsibility (1), Strangeness (1)<br /> <br /> I've been playing with this concept for a while, little realizing just how much of a Disney Princess I've been making. Not sure if that's a good thing! While Order of Hermes mages are known for being bookish pointy hat types, Pauline takes it a step forwards. Horribly shy with her peers and betters, she'd much rather stay in the library that she tends. They in turn realize that she will never make a real contribution to the Order, they are happy to keep her in the library that she loves so much, helping in research and in tutoring apprentices. Her rival is one sided, a peer that wants to keep her down so that they can look better. Pauline doesn't realize that it's happening.<br /> <br /> Other aspects:<br /> A. I've been thinking of having Pauline as a female identifying <i>herm</i>aphrodite, it's a very Order of <i>Hermes</i> thing.<br /> <br /> B. At least one parent is in the chantry, she was raised there without much exposure to the real world.<br /> <br /> C. Pauline looses herself in stories of heroism and adventure. Dreaming of what she could be.. but the real world is scary. She's started writing fanfic.. poorly. Most of her heroes are poorly veiled self insert Mary Sues.<br /> <br /> D, In further Disney fashion, she's popular with small nature and knowledge spirits. Probably too popular. They have yet to craft her a gown and turn a pumpkin into a limousine. Any day now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12228-spectrum","name":"Spectrum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-16T10:48:56-07:00","id":1254793,"title":"","content":"System: Vampire 20<br /> <br /> Name: Donald Washington<br /> 11th Generation Toreador<br /> Concept: Voice of an Angel, Doing What it Takes to Survive<br /> Nature: Conniver, Demeanor: Child<br /> <br /> Str 2, Dex 2, Sta 2<br /> Cha 4 (Nonthreatening), Man 3, App 3<br /> Per 3, Int 2, Wits 3<br /> <br /> Talents: Empathy 3, Expression 4 (Conversation), Leadership 3, Streetwise 2, Subterfuge 4 (Long Con)<br /> Skills: Etiquette 1, Larceny 1, Performance 5 (Singing) <br /> Knowledges: Academics 3 (Religion), Law 3 (Traditions), Politics 3 (Camarilla)<br /> <br /> Backgrounds: Generation 2, Influence 1, Resources 2, Retainers 1, Status 2 <br /> <br /> Virtues: Conscience 3, Self Control 3, Courage 4, Humanity 6, Willpower 6<br /> <br /> Disciplines: Presence 3<br /> <br /> Merits: Enchanting Voice, Sanctity<br /> Flaws: Child, Short<br /> <br /> Donald (never Donnie) was going to make it. He was going to get out of the worst parts of town and he was going to go to college. He stayed away from the gangs, he studied in school, he sang in Church. This last piece attracted attention. His sire watched Donald carefully, knowing all too well that maturity stole the voice of too many young men. In older days, turning the young man into a castrato was an option; but an Embrace could preserve things. It was tempting, each day risking the chance of that golden voice being lost. The decision was made by outside forces beyond the Sires control- a stray bullet ripping through a bedroom window, Donald lying dying upon the ground, this precious voice could not be lost.. and so Donald was Embraced. Donald has attempted to continue on in his previously chosen path but has proven too difficult. Too many threats out there. He has taken to staying in Elysiums, feeling oddly safe among chained Beasts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12228-spectrum","name":"Spectrum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-16T10:53:52-07:00","id":1254794,"title":"","content":"System: Changeling 20<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/236x/39/3a/60/393a60347e8fb440553a33542843b7b8--ginger-girls-red-s.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/u06znLp.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Tessa Fowler. Kate Upton and Christina Lucci were also inspirations. General NSFW warning if you decide to look any of them up.<br /> <br /> Name: Rose Maye <br /> Concept: <a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/ManicPixieDreamGirl\" target=\"_blank\">Manic (Satyr) Dream Girl</a><br /> Seeming: Wilder, Kith: Satyr, Court: Seelie, Legacies: Troubador, Knave<br /> <br /> Willpower: 4, Glamour: 5, Banality: 3<br /> <br /> Str 1; Dex 4 (Slinky); Sta 4 (Tireless)<br /> Cha 4 (Outgoing), Man 2, App 4 (Captivating)<br /> Per 2, Int 2, Wits 2<br /> <br /> Talents: Athletics 3, Empathy 3, Expression 2, Kenning 3, Leadership 4 (Friendly) <br /> Skills: Animal Ken 3, Melee 3, Performance 4 (Erotic)<br /> Knowledges: Academics 1, Computers 1, Law 1, Medicine 1, Technology 1<br /> <br /> Backgrounds: Dreamers 3, Resources 3, Retinue 1<br /> <br /> Arts: Metamorphosis 2, Oneiromancy 2<br /> Realms: Actor 3, Fae 2, Prop 1<br /> <br /> Merits: Friendly Face, Surreal Beauty, Good Listener, Higher Purpose (Spread Love), Natural Leader<br /> Flaws: Impatient, Soft Hearted, Changelings Eyes (Startling Blue), Bizzare Quality<br /> <br /> A. Manic Pixie Dreamgirl is a TV tropes term for those female characters that pull a stodgy male character into a world of wild and whimsy. I'm taking that a step further with Rose. If she's on the Seelie side (Troubadour), things usually turn out and our hero protagonist gets a new outlook on life and a new direction. If she's on the Unseelie side (Knave), things get messy and the guy is left in a disaster.<br /> <br /> B. Rose is also a sex worker. I haven't decided what that actually means but leaning heavily towards her being a cam girl. In that case, her Retinue represents a tech (Gary? Brenda?) that she has helped but he hasn't left her. In any case, the Dreamers represent people that she is currently helping free themselves.<br /> <br /> C. Growth plans: She may pick up a point in Title and be asked to join House Fiona. I was considering adding Naming so that she could talk with animals but the realm cost was way too high. Metamorphosis 3 so that she can start turning into animals and eventually fantastic creatures. Oneiromancy so that she could spend more time in dreams, becoming literally a dream girl (maybe too anime?). Melee specialization would become impromptu weapons- I like the idea of flying frying pans or lamps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12228-spectrum","name":"Spectrum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-16T11:00:18-07:00","id":1254798,"title":"","content":"System: Mage 20<br /> <b>Shawna Milhouse</b><br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/R2N4bQV.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4M9k9lL.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Tradition: Akashic Brotherhood<br /> Essence: Dynamic<br /> Nature: Sensualist<br /> Demeanor: Mentor<br /> <br /> Arete 3, Willpower 6<br /> <br /> Str 3, Dex 3, Sta 4 (Inexhaustible)<br /> Cha 3, Man 3, App 3<br /> Per 2, Int 2, Wits 2<br /> <br /> Talents: Athletics 4 (Fitness), Carousing 1, Do 2, Empathy 2, Instruction 2, Leadership 3<br /> Skills: Acrobatics 3, Meditation 3, Stealth 1, Survival 2<br /> Knowledges: Academics 1, Esoteric 3 (Body Control), Medicine 3<br /> <br /> Backgrounds: Avatar 2, Certification (Physical Therapist) 2, Destiny 3, Patron 1 (a client), Resources 1<br /> <br /> Spheres: Forces 2, Life 3<br /> <br /> Merits: Natural Shapeshifter<br /> Flaws: Bigot (The 'foolish'), Intemperate<br /> <br /> Paradigms: <br /> Practices: martial arts, yoga, meditation, medicine work<br /> Foci: body work, dance, food and drink, meditation, knots and ropes, clothing, ordeals<br /> <br /> Shawna was one of those kids that. Could. Never. Stop. Moving. Never really too interested in people her own age- they were loud and crazy and *ugh* <i>useless</i>! She would instead see how high up a tree she could climb, how far and fast she could ride her bike, how far she could throw a stone across a lake, how many flips she could pull off in a row. She did okay-ish at school, did the least she had to get by. It just never caught her eye. What can you say about a kid whose best grades are in PE? <br /> <br /> High school was a little bit better, well parts of it. Lots of people tried to push her towards cheerleading or basketball or team oriented sports. What really set her on her path though was helping out as an assistant coach- leading 60 Minutes of Hell. It became popular in the sports across the school, a hard workout but one that paid off. <br /> <br /> Middle of senior year, she broke her leg. It was stupid, foolish and something that she shouldn't have failed at. It was also the best thing that happened to her. It would have been easy to let it stop her, but she wouldn't. Looking around at the PT office, she saw other people working towards similar goals. Some of them were due to injury, others were to old age, others due to poor life choices, one of the ladies was a returning GI. She saw people fighting hard to return to a healthier state, some that needed not just physical but emotional support, some would never fully recover. It shook her deeply and gave her a direction to her life. She would help people find the health that she took for granted. They were puzzles, they were challenges, it was what she was meant to do. Shawna found her purpose and Awakened to it.<br /> <br /> During her formal training, she met her mentor, Dr Katherine Tatum of the Akashic Brotherhood. In the years since, they've drifted further apart, coming closer to recognizing each others as equals.<br /> <br /> Now, she has a number of personal clients that she meets with across the area. A challenge to find enough clients to pay the bills but not too many that she loses track of them. And yeah, when she's away from her practice, she's still pushing herself to run faster, jump higher, be better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12228-spectrum","name":"Spectrum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-16T11:01:11-07:00","id":1254799,"title":"","content":"System: Vampire 20<br /> <b>Rancid Hemorrhagic Prolapse</b><br /> <img src=\"http://i.ytimg.com/vi/mCAut0-jbpQ/0.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Clan: Nosferatu, 10th Generation<br /> Nature: Trickster<br /> Demeanor: Creep Show<br /> <br /> Str 2, Dex 3, Sta 3<br /> Cha 1, Man 4 (Provocative), App 0<br /> Per 2, Int 4 (Creative), Wits 4 (Witty)<br /> <br /> Talents: Brawl 1, Empathy 4 (Insight), Expression 4 (Music/Stage Design), Intimidation 3, Leadership 3<br /> Skills: Etiquette 1, Performance 4 (Stage Arts), Stealth 1<br /> Knowledges: Academics 3, Finance 1, Occult 3, Science 1, Technology 2<br /> <br /> Backgrounds: Contacts 2, Fame 2 (Shock rocker), Generation 3, Herd 3 (groupies), Retainers 2 (manager and chief roadie)<br /> <br /> Disciplines: Obfuscate 2, Potence 1<br /> <br /> Conscience 1, Self Control 4, Humanity 5, Courage 5, Willpower 5<br /> <br /> Merits: Enchanting Voice, Eidetic Memory, Open Road, Monstrous Maw<br /> Flaws: Glowing Eyes, Beacon of the Unholy, Eerie Presence<br /> <br /> Screamin' Jay Hawkins<br /> Alice Cooper<br /> Black Sabbath<br /> KISS<br /> GG Allin<br /> GWAR<br /> Marilyn Manson<br /> Insane Clown Posse<br /> Mushroomhead<br /> Slipknot<br /> Lordi<br /> <br /> The Masquerade died long ago in Rock and Roll. Get the (bleep) over it or get run over you dessicated piece of (bleep). PMRC, Bless that (extended bleep) Tipper Gore's black and shriveled heart, was an inspiration. She told us what we couldn't do so we just did it louder and harder and.. heh heh. <br /> <br /> Next question!<br /> <br /> No, this isn't a (bleep) mask you (bleep) piece of (bleep). This is real. This is forever. You will never see me any other way. There is no other way. Don't even (bleep) try. Someone lynch him for being an idiot. Heh heh, no, really. Someone (bleep)ing do it.<br /> <br /> I'm bored. You haven't wasted too much of my time. You owe me though. Buy The Bar Bitch You Ate. Put some noise in your ears and money in my pockets.<br /> <br /> Inspiration: The stage antics of Alice Cooper. The drive for money of Gene Simmons. The putrid behavior of GG Allin. The social awareness of Marilyn Manson. The sweet voice of Corey Taylor. The commitment to kayfabe of Lordi.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12228-spectrum","name":"Spectrum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}